{"seq":3,"slug":"performance-profiling","title":"系统级性能分析与调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice/performance-profiling","wordCount":746,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"系统级性能分析与调优\">系统级性能分析与调优</h1><p>系统编程的性能优化不是猜测——它是测量。Rust 提供了从编译期零成本验证到运行时纳秒级 profiling 的完整工具链。本文覆盖 Rust 系统级代码的性能分析方法论：基准测试框架、CPU profiler、内存分析器、以及针对缓存、分支预测和 SIMD 的底层优化手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>性能分析遵循「测量 → 定位 → 优化 → 验证」的闭环。永远先用 profiler 定位热点，再针对性优化，最后用基准测试验证改善。过早优化和直觉驱动的优化是系统编程中最大的时间浪费。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[编写基准测试] --&gt; B[运行 profiler]&#10;    B --&gt; C[定位热点函数]&#10;    C --&gt; D[分析瓶颈类型]&#10;    D --&gt; E{瓶颈类别}&#10;    E --&gt;|CPU bound| F[算法优化 / SIMD]&#10;    E --&gt;|Memory bound| G[缓存优化 / 预取]&#10;    E --&gt;|I/O bound| H[异步 / io_uring]&#10;    E --&gt;|分支误预测| I[branchless 重写]&#10;    F --&gt; J[重新基准测试验证]&#10;    G --&gt; J&#10;    H --&gt; J&#10;    I --&gt; J&#10;    J --&gt;|性能达标| K[完成]&#10;    J --&gt;|仍有瓶颈| B\">graph LR\n    A[编写基准测试] --&gt; B[运行 profiler]\n    B --&gt; C[定位热点函数]\n    C --&gt; D[分析瓶颈类型]\n    D --&gt; E{瓶颈类别}\n    E --&gt;|CPU bound| F[算法优化 / SIMD]\n    E --&gt;|Memory bound| G[缓存优化 / 预取]\n    E --&gt;|I/O bound| H[异步 / io_uring]\n    E --&gt;|分支误预测| I[branchless 重写]\n    F --&gt; J[重新基准测试验证]\n    G --&gt; J\n    H --&gt; J\n    I --&gt; J\n    J --&gt;|性能达标| K[完成]\n    J --&gt;|仍有瓶颈| B</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>criterion</td>\n<td>统计基准测试</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n<td>微基准、回归检测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>perf</td>\n<td>采样 profiler</td>\n<td>Linux</td>\n<td>CPU 热点定位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>flamegraph</td>\n<td>可视化</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n<td>调用栈热图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>valgrind/cachegrind</td>\n<td>模拟器</td>\n<td>Linux</td>\n<td>缓存命中分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>heaptrack</td>\n<td>堆分析</td>\n<td>Linux</td>\n<td>内存分配追踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>cargo-show-asm</td>\n<td>编译期</td>\n<td>跨平台</td>\n<td>验证零成本抽象</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DHAT</td>\n<td>堆 profiler</td>\n<td>Linux</td>\n<td>分配位点追踪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"criterion-统计基准测试\">Criterion 统计基准测试</h2><p>criterion 是 Rust 基准测试的事实标准。它使用统计学方法消除测量噪声，自动检测性能回归，输出带置信区间的结果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use criterion::{criterion_group, criterion_main, Criterion, black_box};&#10;&#10;fn bench_lookup(c: &amp;mut Criterion) {&#10;    let map: HashMap&lt;u64, u64&gt; = (0..10000).map(|i| (i, i * 2)).collect();&#10;&#10;    c.bench_function(&quot;hashmap_lookup_hit&quot;, |b| {&#10;        b.iter(|| {&#10;            let key = black_box(5000u64);&#10;            map.get(&amp;key)&#10;        })&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    c.bench_function(&quot;hashmap_lookup_miss&quot;, |b| {&#10;        b.iter(|| {&#10;            let key = black_box(99999u64);&#10;            map.get(&amp;key)&#10;        })&#10;    });&#10;}&#10;&#10;fn bench_sorting(c: &amp;mut Criterion) {&#10;    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(&quot;sorting&quot;);&#10;&#10;    for size in [100, 1000, 10000, 100000] {&#10;        group.bench_with_input(&#10;            criterion::BenchmarkId::new(&quot;std_sort&quot;, size),&#10;            &amp;size,&#10;            |b, &amp;size| {&#10;                let mut data: Vec&lt;u64&gt; = (0..size).rev().collect();&#10;                b.iter(|| {&#10;                    data.sort_unstable();&#10;                    black_box(&amp;data);&#10;                })&#10;            },&#10;        );&#10;    }&#10;    group.finish();&#10;}&#10;&#10;criterion_group!(benches, bench_lookup, bench_sorting);&#10;criterion_main!(benches);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use criterion::{criterion_group, criterion_main, Criterion, black_box};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn bench_lookup(c: &#x26;mut Criterion) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let map: HashMap&#x3C;u64, u64> = (0..10000).map(|i| (i, i * 2)).collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c.bench_function(\"hashmap_lookup_hit\", |b| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        b.iter(|| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let key = black_box(5000u64);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            map.get(&#x26;key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c.bench_function(\"hashmap_lookup_miss\", |b| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        b.iter(|| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            let key = black_box(99999u64);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            map.get(&#x26;key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn bench_sorting(c: &#x26;mut Criterion) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut group = c.benchmark_group(\"sorting\");</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for size in [100, 1000, 10000, 100000] {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        group.bench_with_input(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            criterion::BenchmarkId::new(\"std_sort\", size),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x26;size,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            |b, &#x26;size| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                let mut data: Vec&#x3C;u64> = (0..size).rev().collect();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                b.iter(|| {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    data.sort_unstable();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    black_box(&#x26;data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    group.finish();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>criterion_group!(benches, bench_lookup, bench_sorting);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>criterion_main!(benches);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>black_box</code> 阻止编译器优化掉未使用的计算结果。忘记使用它会导致基准测试测量的是空操作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"perf-flamegraph-热点定位\">perf + flamegraph 热点定位</h2><p>Linux perf 是系统级 profiling 的黄金标准。配合 <code>cargo-flamegraph</code> 可以一键生成火焰图。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 安装&#10;cargo install flamegraph&#10;&#10;# 生成火焰图（自动调用 perf record + 符号解析）&#10;cargo flamegraph --bin my_server -- --port 8080&#10;&#10;# 手动使用 perf（更精细控制）&#10;perf record -g --call-graph=dwarf target/release/my_server &amp;&#10;# ... 施加负载 ...&#10;kill %1&#10;perf script | inferno-collapse-perf | inferno-flamegraph &gt; flamegraph.svg\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 安装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flamegraph</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成火焰图（自动调用 perf record + 符号解析）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">cargo</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flamegraph</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --bin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> my_server</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --port</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 8080</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 手动使用 perf（更精细控制）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> record</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -g</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --call-graph=dwarf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target/release/my_server</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> &#x26;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ... 施加负载 ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">kill</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> %1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">perf</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> script</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inferno-collapse-perf</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> inferno-flamegraph</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> flamegraph.svg</span></span></code></pre></div><p>解读火焰图的关键：宽度表示函数在采样中出现的比例（即 CPU 时间占比）。最宽的「平台」是优化的首要目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓存友好的数据结构设计\">缓存友好的数据结构设计</h2><p>现代 CPU 的内存访问延迟：L1 约 1ns、L2 约 4ns、L3 约 12ns、主存约 100ns。数据结构的缓存友好性往往比算法复杂度更重要。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 缓存不友好：AoS（Array of Structs）&#10;// 遍历 position 时，velocity 和 health 污染缓存行&#10;struct Entity {&#10;    position: [f32; 3],    // 12 bytes&#10;    velocity: [f32; 3],    // 12 bytes&#10;    health: f32,           // 4 bytes&#10;    _padding: [u8; 4],     // 4 bytes = 32 bytes per entity&#10;}&#10;let entities: Vec&lt;Entity&gt; = Vec::with_capacity(100_000);&#10;&#10;// 缓存友好：SoA（Struct of Arrays）&#10;// 遍历 position 时，连续内存全是 position 数据&#10;struct Entities {&#10;    positions: Vec&lt;[f32; 3]&gt;,   // 紧凑排列&#10;    velocities: Vec&lt;[f32; 3]&gt;,&#10;    healths: Vec&lt;f32&gt;,&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 缓存不友好：AoS（Array of Structs）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 遍历 position 时，velocity 和 health 污染缓存行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Entity {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    position: [f32; 3],    // 12 bytes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    velocity: [f32; 3],    // 12 bytes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    health: f32,           // 4 bytes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    _padding: [u8; 4],     // 4 bytes = 32 bytes per entity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let entities: Vec&#x3C;Entity> = Vec::with_capacity(100_000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 缓存友好：SoA（Struct of Arrays）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 遍历 position 时，连续内存全是 position 数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>struct Entities {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    positions: Vec&#x3C;[f32; 3]>,   // 紧凑排列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    velocities: Vec&#x3C;[f32; 3]>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    healths: Vec&#x3C;f32>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>SoA 布局在遍历单个字段时的性能通常是 AoS 的 2-4 倍——差距来自缓存行利用率从 ~37%（12/32）提升到 100%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分支预测优化\">分支预测优化</h2><p>CPU 的分支预测器在预测正确时零开销，预测失败时约 15-20 个时钟周期的惩罚。对于不可预测的分支，branchless 重写可以显著提速。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"// 有分支版本：在随机数据上分支预测失败率约 50%&#10;fn min_branching(a: i32, b: i32) -&gt; i32 {&#10;    if a &lt; b { a } else { b }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 无分支版本：使用条件移动指令（CMOVcc）&#10;fn min_branchless(a: i32, b: i32) -&gt; i32 {&#10;    let diff = a.wrapping_sub(b);&#10;    let mask = diff &gt;&gt; 31;  // 全 1 如果 a &lt; b，否则全 0&#10;    b.wrapping_add(diff &amp; mask)&#10;}&#10;&#10;// Rust 标准库的 min/max 通常已经被 LLVM 优化为 CMOVcc&#10;// 但在复杂条件下可能需要手动帮助&#10;fn clamp_branchless(value: i32, min: i32, max: i32) -&gt; i32 {&#10;    value.max(min).min(max)  // LLVM 生成两个 CMOVcc&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 有分支版本：在随机数据上分支预测失败率约 50%</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn min_branching(a: i32, b: i32) -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if a &#x3C; b { a } else { b }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 无分支版本：使用条件移动指令（CMOVcc）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn min_branchless(a: i32, b: i32) -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let diff = a.wrapping_sub(b);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mask = diff >> 31;  // 全 1 如果 a &#x3C; b，否则全 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    b.wrapping_add(diff &#x26; mask)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// Rust 标准库的 min/max 通常已经被 LLVM 优化为 CMOVcc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 但在复杂条件下可能需要手动帮助</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn clamp_branchless(value: i32, min: i32, max: i32) -> i32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    value.max(min).min(max)  // LLVM 生成两个 CMOVcc</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用 <code>likely</code>/<code>unlikely</code> hint（nightly）告诉编译器分支概率：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#![feature(core_intrinsics)]&#10;&#10;fn process_packet(packet: &amp;[u8]) -&gt; Result&lt;(), Error&gt; {&#10;    if std::intrinsics::unlikely(packet.len() &lt; 4) {&#10;        return Err(Error::TooShort);&#10;    }&#10;    // 热路径代码...&#10;    Ok(())&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#![feature(core_intrinsics)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn process_packet(packet: &#x26;[u8]) -> Result&#x3C;(), Error> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if std::intrinsics::unlikely(packet.len() &#x3C; 4) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Err(Error::TooShort);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 热路径代码...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    Ok(())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"simd-向量化\">SIMD 向量化</h2><p>Rust 通过 <code>std::simd</code>（nightly）和 <code>std::arch</code> 提供 SIMD 支持。对于稳定版，<code>packed_simd</code> 和手写 intrinsics 是可选路径。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"#[cfg(target_arch = &quot;x86_64&quot;)]&#10;use std::arch::x86_64::*;&#10;&#10;/// 使用 AVX2 计算两个 f32 数组的点积&#10;#[cfg(target_arch = &quot;x86_64&quot;)]&#10;#[target_feature(enable = &quot;avx2&quot;)]&#10;unsafe fn dot_product_avx2(a: &amp;[f32], b: &amp;[f32]) -&gt; f32 {&#10;    assert_eq!(a.len(), b.len());&#10;    let n = a.len();&#10;    let chunks = n / 8;&#10;&#10;    let mut sum = _mm256_setzero_ps();&#10;&#10;    for i in 0..chunks {&#10;        let va = _mm256_loadu_ps(a.as_ptr().add(i * 8));&#10;        let vb = _mm256_loadu_ps(b.as_ptr().add(i * 8));&#10;        sum = _mm256_fmadd_ps(va, vb, sum);  // FMA: sum += a * b&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    // 水平求和&#10;    let hi = _mm256_extractf128_ps(sum, 1);&#10;    let lo = _mm256_castps256_ps128(sum);&#10;    let sum128 = _mm_add_ps(hi, lo);&#10;    let shuf = _mm_movehdup_ps(sum128);&#10;    let sums = _mm_add_ps(sum128, shuf);&#10;    let shuf2 = _mm_movehl_ps(sums, sums);&#10;    let result = _mm_add_ss(sums, shuf2);&#10;&#10;    let mut scalar = _mm_cvtss_f32(result);&#10;&#10;    // 处理剩余元素&#10;    for i in (chunks * 8)..n {&#10;        scalar += a[i] * b[i];&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    scalar&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(target_arch = \"x86_64\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::arch::x86_64::*;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>/// 使用 AVX2 计算两个 f32 数组的点积</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[cfg(target_arch = \"x86_64\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>#[target_feature(enable = \"avx2\")]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unsafe fn dot_product_avx2(a: &#x26;[f32], b: &#x26;[f32]) -> f32 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    assert_eq!(a.len(), b.len());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let n = a.len();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let chunks = n / 8;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut sum = _mm256_setzero_ps();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in 0..chunks {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let va = _mm256_loadu_ps(a.as_ptr().add(i * 8));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let vb = _mm256_loadu_ps(b.as_ptr().add(i * 8));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        sum = _mm256_fmadd_ps(va, vb, sum);  // FMA: sum += a * b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 水平求和</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let hi = _mm256_extractf128_ps(sum, 1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let lo = _mm256_castps256_ps128(sum);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let sum128 = _mm_add_ps(hi, lo);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let shuf = _mm_movehdup_ps(sum128);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let sums = _mm_add_ps(sum128, shuf);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let shuf2 = _mm_movehl_ps(sums, sums);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let result = _mm_add_ss(sums, shuf2);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut scalar = _mm_cvtss_f32(result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    // 处理剩余元素</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for i in (chunks * 8)..n {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        scalar += a[i] * b[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    scalar</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>性能优化闭环：测量(criterion) → 定位(perf/flamegraph) → 优化 → 验证</li>\n<li>SoA 布局提升缓存利用率，遍历单字段时快 2-4 倍</li>\n<li>branchless 代码消除不可预测分支的 15-20 周期惩罚</li>\n<li>SIMD 通过数据并行在单条指令处理 4-8 个元素</li>\n<li><code>black_box</code> 是基准测试的必备工具，防止死代码消除</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章上一篇 <a href=\"ffi-and-c-interop\">FFI 与 C 互操作</a> 覆盖如何安全包装 C 性能库</li>\n<li>跨库参考：<a href=\"../../rust-language/systems-programming/performance-benchmarking\">Rust 语言 - 性能基准测试</a> 覆盖 Rust 性能测试的基础方法</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"系统级性能分析与调优","id":"系统级性能分析与调优"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Criterion 统计基准测试","id":"criterion-统计基准测试"},{"level":2,"text":"perf + flamegraph 热点定位","id":"perf-flamegraph-热点定位"},{"level":2,"text":"缓存友好的数据结构设计","id":"缓存友好的数据结构设计"},{"level":2,"text":"分支预测优化","id":"分支预测优化"},{"level":2,"text":"SIMD 向量化","id":"simd-向量化"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"FFI 与 C 互操作工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-systems-programming/practice/ffi-and-c-interop"},"next":null}